Thanks for sending an update.  Glad to hear that you were able to get
RBGL working on your system.  

Just to clarify a bit on what I think the issues are:

RBGL includes prepackaged sources from the Boost Graph Library
(heavily templated C++).  It's this library code that fails to compile
on the newer gcc's.  This isn't really a Bioc issue as much as a Boost
issue and ideally, the Boost project will fix their code.

